Create/update a UI investor page named mtk-investor.

TECHNOLOGY
- HTML
- SCSS
- Generated CSS from the SCSS file
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Bootstrap 5 for layout only
- Modern Material Design
- Google Material Icons
- jQuery may be loaded by index.html, but mtk-investor itself should use Vanilla JavaScript
- Use the existing js/_wc.js from:
  https://github.com/NYCMEL/nala-website/blob/main/js/_wc.js
- Do NOT create a replacement include system.
- Do NOT use frameworks.

NALA STYLING
- Use styles, colors, fonts, spacing, shadows, breakpoints, etc. from:
  css/nala.scss
- Use the version from branch:
  08.12.2026
- Repository:
  NYCMEL/nala-website
- Keep the visual design consistent with the NALA brand.
- Primary dark header/footer with NALA gold accents.
- Use the real NALA logo:
  logo-nala-association.webp
- NEVER use header.png.
- Do NOT generate any images.

COMPONENT
The investor page must be wrapped in:

<mtk-investor class="mtk-investor">

The root CSS class must be:

.mtk-investor

All component styles MUST be scoped underneath:

.mtk-investor

Do not create global component styles.

Do not use IDs.

JAVASCRIPT
- Always create a JavaScript class named MtkInvestor.
- Initialize MtkInvestor inside mtk-investor.js itself.
- Do not require inline JavaScript.
- mtk-investor may be dynamically inserted using <wc-include>.
- The JavaScript MUST wait until the mtk-investor element exists in the DOM before initialization.
- It must work correctly when loaded dynamically.
- Prevent duplicate initialization.
- MutationObserver may be used to detect dynamically inserted content.

WC EVENTS
- Publish component click events using wc.publish.
- Before EVERY wc.publish call, log the message using wc.log.
- Subscribe to all four mtk-investor events using wc.subscribe.
- Create an onMessage function.
- Pass onMessage to wc.subscribe.

The four component events are:

mtk-investor:cta
mtk-investor:nav
mtk-investor:metric
mtk-investor:contact

DATA
The entire investor page must be JSON driven.

ALL:
- labels
- navigation
- headings
- paragraphs
- metrics
- buttons
- icons
- news
- investment information
- mission information
- footer information
- links
- accessibility labels
- event configuration

must come from:

mtk-investor.config.js

Do not hardcode displayed business content in mtk-investor.js or mtk-investor.html.

HEADER
Create a NALA investor header.

Desktop:
- Dark NALA background.
- Real NALA logo positioned on the LEFT.
- Logo must remain left aligned.
- Navigation positioned on the right.
- Navigation:
  OVERVIEW
  FINANCIALS
  GOVERNANCE
  NEWS
  RESOURCES
  CONTACT
- CONTACT must contain a Material email icon.
- CONTACT must behave as an email link.
- Do not display the word "Email".
- Only one navigation item may appear selected at a time.
- Overview is selected initially.
- When another navigation item is clicked, remove the selected state from Overview.
- Selected navigation uses the NALA gold color and underline.
- Menu clicks must smoothly scroll to the appropriate section.
- Scrolling must compensate for the header height.
- Section headings must NEVER disappear underneath the header.

Mobile:
- Header must use the same visual structure and behavior as the mobile footer.
- Compact dark bar.
- Hamburger icon on the LEFT.
- NALA logo immediately to the RIGHT of the hamburger.
- Logo remains left aligned.
- Navigation must NOT display when the page initially loads.
- Clicking the hamburger opens the navigation.
- Hamburger changes to close icon when open.
- Clicking it again closes navigation.
- Clicking a navigation item closes the navigation.
- No large blank area may appear underneath the logo.
- Header height must be auto and compact when menu is closed.
- Header expands only when the menu is open.
- Navigation appears below the hamburger/logo row.
- Mobile header and footer menu behavior must be identical.

FOOTER
- Footer should visually match the header.
- Dark NALA background.
- Real NALA logo.
- Same navigation:
  OVERVIEW
  FINANCIALS
  GOVERNANCE
  NEWS
  RESOURCES
  CONTACT
- CONTACT includes Material email icon and acts as an email link.
- Desktop navigation should be visible.
- Mobile navigation must be inside a hamburger.
- Hamburger must be LEFT of the logo.
- Footer mobile menu must initially be closed.
- Header and footer mobile menus must use the same layout and behavior.

HERO
Create a strong investor landing-page hero.

Do NOT use a globe background image.

Do NOT generate a globe image.

Do NOT generate any images.

Use a clean NALA-branded background.

Hero content should include investor-focused:
- eyebrow
- large headline
- supporting copy
- primary CTA
- secondary CTA

AT A GLANCE
Include an investor overview section.

Include four JSON-driven metric cards.

Example structure:
- metric icon
- metric value
- metric title
- supporting text

All values must be configurable.

MISSION / VISION / VALUES / INVESTORS
Include the dark NALA information band containing:

OUR MISSION
OUR VISION
OUR VALUES
FOR INVESTORS

Each item should include:
- Material icon
- heading
- description

Desktop:
Display horizontally.

Mobile:
Stack cleanly vertically.

INVESTMENT THESIS
Include:

INVESTMENT THESIS
Four priorities guide the business

Include four configurable priorities such as:
01 Grow the core
02 Scale efficiently
03 Invest selectively
04 Compound trust

Each includes:
- number
- Material icon
- title
- description

INVESTOR HIGHLIGHTS
Include a dark/gold investor highlights section.

Example heading:

Designed for clarity, not noise

Include configurable investor benefits/features.

LATEST UPDATES / INVESTOR INFORMATION
Include investor information cards such as:

Quarterly results
Annual report
Investor events

Each card should contain:
- period/status
- Material icon
- heading
- description
- action

STAY INFORMED
Include:

Follow NALA's investor story

Include supporting investor-relations text and an Investor Relations CTA.

LATEST NEWS
Add a Latest News section near the bottom of the page.

Heading:

Latest News

Include:

VIEW ALL NEWS →

Display three configurable news cards.

Each news card contains:
- date
- title
- visual/icon area
- action

The Latest News section must be JSON driven.

Do NOT generate news images.

Material icons may be used if actual existing image assets are not provided.

SECTION SPACING
Use consistent vertical spacing across ALL main content sections.

Desktop:
48px top
48px bottom

Mobile:
32px top
32px bottom

Do not allow individual sections to introduce large unexplained vertical gaps.

TO-TOP
Add a To-Top Material icon/button.

- Hidden near the top of the page.
- Appears after the user scrolls.
- Clicking it smoothly scrolls to the top.
- Keyboard accessible.
- Visible focus state.

ACCESSIBILITY
- Semantic HTML5.
- ADA/WCAG compliant.
- Keyboard accessible.
- Visible focus states.
- Appropriate aria-label attributes.
- aria-expanded on hamburger buttons.
- aria-live where appropriate.
- Decorative icons should use aria-hidden.
- Sufficient color contrast.
- No IDs.

SCSS
- All source styles go in:
  mtk-investor.scss
- Scope everything underneath:
  .mtk-investor
- Use NALA variables/tokens from css/nala.scss.
- Also generate:
  mtk-investor.css
- CSS must reflect the current SCSS.
- Do not leave CSS out of the ZIP.

HTML
- No inline CSS.
- No inline JavaScript.
- Semantic HTML.
- No iframes.
- No IDs.

INDEX.HTML
Create index.html exactly using this integration pattern:

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>NALA Investor Relations</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="investor/mtk-investor.css">

  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-4.0.0.min.js"></script>
</head>

<body>
    <wc-include href="investor/mtk-investor.html"></wc-include>

    <script src="js/_wc.js"></script>
    <script src="investor/mtk-investor.config.js"></script>
    <script src="investor/mtk-investor.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

OUTPUT
Create the complete working project and package it as:

x.zip

The investor files must include:

investor/mtk-investor.config.js
investor/mtk-investor.scss
investor/mtk-investor.css
investor/mtk-investor.html
investor/mtk-investor.js

Also include:

index.html

